    "innovation": "This paper provides an Earth-system perspective arguing that the interactions between the anthropogenically perturbed nitrogen cycle, the carbon cycle, and climate are a crucial, yet poorly understood, determinant of the planet's future and a major source of uncertainty in climate projections.",
