            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "Figure 2 | Changes in the climate system and the global nitrogen and carbon cycles over the past 75,000 years. Data are plotted against age before the year 1950, using the Greenland-based GISP2 age scale. a, The 18O/160 ratio (6180) of ice from Greenland, as a proxy for Greenland temperature22. b, The 8180 of ice from Antarctica, as a proxy for Antarctic temperature22. c, Atmospheric CO2 concentrations as recorded in air bubbles from various Antarctic ice cores (see ref. 23 for original references) and direct atmospheric measurements since 1958. d, Atmospheric N\u2082O concentrations as recorded in air bubbles from various Antarctic and Greenland ice cores 15 and direct atmospheric measurements since the late 1970s. e, 15N/14N ratio (815N) of organic nitrogen from a marine sediment core from the Oman margin in the Arabian Sea\u00b9\u2076. \u2030, parts per thousand; DO, Dansgaard\u2013 Oeschger event; p.p.b., parts per billion; p.p.m., parts per million.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
